                <head>101. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>Between March 8 and 10, Director of the International Cooperation Administration
                        Hollister attended a Mission
                    Directors Conference in Habana, Cuba, where he discussed with them the status of
                        ICA programs in the respective Latin
                    American countries. Memoranda of these conversations, drafted by the Executive
                    Secretary of the ICA, John W.
                        McDonald, and bearing drafting dates between April 5 and 9, are
                    in Washington National Records Center, ICA
                    Director’s Files, FRC 61 A 32, Box 316, Latin
                    America.</p>
            </div>
